# The single source of truth for the CURRENT PUBLISHED RELEASE, the install baseline, in
# CalVer: vYY.M.PATCH for every release before 26.10, bare YY.M.PATCH from 26.10 on (the
# tag-name correction of 2026-09-29; a v-prefixed 26.10.0 and a bare 26.9.0 are both refused
# by scripts/check-release-version.sh). Every release-bearing surface (README ×7, the CHANGELOG masthead, INSTALL,
# the docs-site install and verify pages, the trust one-pager, and the deploy/, packaging/ and
# operator/ coordinates) is checked against this value by scripts/check-release-version.sh on
# every push and in CI. SECURITY.md is not one of those surfaces: scripts/check-install-docs.sh
# requires it to contain v<this value> (its supported-release row), and binds this value to its
# dated witness, docs/releases/<this value>-install-surfaces.json.
#
# THE VALUE NAMES A PUBLISHED RELEASE, NOT A PLAN. v26.9.0 was: public tag v26.9.0, GitHub
# release 390836255, published 2026-09-17T16:33:50Z; its install surfaces were read on
# 2026-09-23 and are recorded in its witness. Both published releases, v26.8.0 and v26.9.0,
# keep their own CHANGELOG.md sections unchanged.
#
# THIS IS THE 26.10.0 CUT, PREPARED TO APPLY AT RELEASE TIME: the canon, the dated changelog
# section and every bound surface in their 26.10.0 state. Its witness,
# docs/releases/26.10.0-install-surfaces.json, is a STAND-IN, marked so in its $comment: the
# real witness is observed from the published surfaces at publication time and replaces it.
#
# HOW A NUMBER IS DERIVED: CalVer takes it from the date of the cut. YY is the two-digit year,
# M the month with no leading zero, and PATCH the release number within that month. The
# calendar derives the number; WHETHER and WHEN a cut happens is the owner's decision.
#
# THERE IS NO UNDECIDED. The checker once answered the value UNDECIDED with a census and
# exit 0; that report mode was removed on 2026-09-23, because it certified a tree with no
# canon behind it. UNDECIDED, or any value outside the two-era CalVer contract above, is
# refused before any
# surface is read, and scripts/check-install-docs.sh binds the current install surfaces to
# the value below through its dated witness.
26.10.0
